# PSWloader GPU driver 0.7.216.1230 (LAB): real resolutions in Windows Settings. The running mode plus every mode with a replay that the
# monitor's EDID offers is offered as source (one per size)/target/monitor mode; a commit of another one switches the hardware
# synchronously (Ps5HpModeChange, no replug). Needs EnableHotplugModeSet bits 1+4. HW 25.11.2026: Settings 1080p60 -> 2560x1440@60,
# hotplug Dell 3440x1440@100 <-> UGREEN (Windows restores its per-monitor mode) all with picture. Against 0.7.216.1229. Test-signed c3359be3.
